WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.860
A French friend tells you:

2
00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.690
«Inès a passé le bac en juin».

3
00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.990
Then she adds: «elle ne l'a pas eu».

4
00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:08.770
So did she pass, or not?

5
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:14.680
Most do. In 2025, 91.6
per cent passed «le bac»,

6
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.450
and 80.1 per cent of a
generation now hold it.

7
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.500
So if most of them get there,

8
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.840
why do so many students
still feel the pressure?

9
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:27.860
In this mission, you'll climb the
French school system step by step,

10
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.490
from nursery school to «le bac».

11
00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.370
Then you'll crack the false
friends of French school,

12
00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.440
starting with «le collège».

13
00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.730
Your mission: work out why
students feel under pressure

14
00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:40.360
when most of them succeed.
